#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:3
#: 313f56c6573d49c2a9f0c42486a42d90
msgid ""
"`NEP Dataset Display` 是用来查看、筛选和导出结构数据的页面。它有两类常见用"
"途："
msgstr ""
"`NEP Dataset Display` is the workspace for inspecting, selecting, and "
"exporting structure data. It supports two common stages of a dataset "
"workflow:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:5
#: 19a9a96e34d94787b962aaa8a68a783a
msgid ""
"**DFT 之前**：把 `生成数据集` 生成的候选结构导入进来，先删掉明显异常结构，再"
"采样去 DFT。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:6
#: c56fc97495cf47739274c0d0a61b6221
msgid ""
"**训练之后**：导入训练结构和模型输出，找误差大的结构，判断下一轮数据应该补哪"
"里。"
msgstr ""
"**After training**: load the training structures and model output, locate "
"high-error structures, and decide which region needs more data in the next "
"iteration."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:8
#: 2ff0fbc41e624a2898641d9e79c8fc4d
msgid ""
"它不是训练器，也不替代 DFT。这里的重点是把结构和图上的异常点连起来，让你能快"
"速决定： 保留、删除、导出，还是回到上游重新生成。"
msgstr ""
"It is not a trainer and does not replace DFT. Its job is to connect points "
"in a plot with their actual structures so that you can decide whether to "
"keep, remove, export, or regenerate them upstream."

