#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:53
#: 07be2afbb90e4beaa0d576a7913de517
msgid ""
"加载数据后，打开顶部 `Save` 分裂菜单，点击 `评估当前数据集`。软件会检查当前活"
"动结构，并进入「训练集评估」的概览页。"
msgstr ""
"After loading data, open the `Save` split menu and choose `Check current "
"dataset`. NepTrainKit audits the active structures and opens the Training "
"Set Audit overview."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:55
#: d7033d5ed2d64fc8a2e67c870e17db82
msgid ""
"如果只想查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差的分布，可以点击左侧图表工具栏中的 "
"`查看数据分布`。它会直接打开同一页面的「数据地图 → 数据分布」，点击柱形分箱后"
"仍可把对应结构选回 `NEP Dataset Display`。"
msgstr ""
"To inspect only the distribution of energy, force, virial, predictions, or "
"errors, click `Explore distributions` in the plot toolbar. This opens `Data "
"map → Data distribution` on the same audit page. Selecting a histogram bin "
"can still send the matching structures back to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:57
#: f0da327c6495446aadd2e9824d92accf
msgid ""
"训练集评估还可以按精确组分查看结构数量，并对全部结构分析 FCC、HCP、BCC、L1₂、"
"Laves 相结构，以及 FM、AFM、FiM、PM-like 等 `spin:R:3` 磁类型。完整用法、判"
"据、占比视图和限制见 [训练集评估](training-set-assessment.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit also groups structures by exact composition and analyzes "
"FCC, HCP, BCC, L1₂, and Laves structural phases together with `spin:R:3` "
"magnetic types such as FM, AFM, FiM, and PM-like. See [Training Set Audit]"
"(training-set-assessment.md) for the workflow, criteria, share views, and "
"limitations."

