msgstr ""
"Inspect the corresponding structure and `Config_type` on the right to "
"determine where the error comes from."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:103
#: 2d3cf85071e241aaaa3d17f2e6482232
msgid "导出这些结构，作为下一轮补数据或排查 DFT 标签的入口。"
